# Functional

1. Sign-up (done), sign-in (done), reset-password (done),
2. Edit,get profile (done).
3. Channel: create-channel, get-channel-list, delete-channel (done)

4. Start group chats (limit 100 users) (done)
5. Send-receive messages (done)
6. Access messages after they've been offline (done)
7. Ack message (done).
8. Deleted offline messages after delivery (done)
9. Heartbeat / Ping-Pong Keep WebSocket alive, detect disconnects (done)
10. Last Active / Online Status Show when user was last online (done)

11. Typing Indicator Real-time feedback (handled by FE)

12. Send/receive media
13. Media Sharing (S3 Presigned URLs) Images, videos, files

14. Audio/Video calling.

# Core entity

1. Users
2. Chats (2-100 users)
3. Messages
4. Clients (a user might have multiple devices)

# Commands

## Sent

- createChat
- sendMessage
- createAttachment
- modifyParticipants

## Received

- newMessage
- chatUpdate
